Add the missing <cstdint> include to SmallVector.h.

SmallVectorSizeType names uint64_t/uint32_t without including <cstdint>. Older
libstdc++ headers happened to drag the declarations in transitively; GCC 15's
do not, so every translation unit that reaches SmallVector.h fails to compile.

Fixed upstream by 3fdca1e2 ("[ADT] Add missing includes"); backported here
because the Bazel module is pinned to 17.0.4.

diff --git a/llvm/include/llvm/ADT/SmallVector.h b/llvm/include/llvm/ADT/SmallVector.h
--- a/llvm/include/llvm/ADT/SmallVector.h
+++ b/llvm/include/llvm/ADT/SmallVector.h
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@
 #include <algorithm>
 #include <cassert>
 #include <cstddef>
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <cstdlib>
 #include <cstring>
 #include <functional>
